# Ask Dev — build-time configuration (CHAOS-12106).
#
# Copy to `.env.local` (git-ignored). The app is a browser OAuth client of ACR: it holds no key,
# no assertion and no identity of its own. NEXT_PUBLIC_* is inlined into the public bundle by
# `next build`, so a value here must be public. Never put a credential in one.

# ACR's OAuth issuer: an exact origin (https, or http on a loopback host), with no path or trailing
# slash. Unset, the app has no ACR client and every question ends "Ask Dev is not configured here."
# ACR's development browser client `https://localhost/acr/dev-browser-client` holds the redirect
# `http://localhost:3021/oauth/callback` and the CORS origin `http://localhost:3021`.
NEXT_PUBLIC_ACR_OAUTH_ISSUER=http://localhost:18080
